  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza Sings: Young Palestine Raises Its Voice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Music Education &amp; Development 2016-2019 Edward Said: 
The project supports the ESNCM&apos;s educational programs in 3 main components: a) Support to Gaza Music School  ( regular 170 students 60% females), and b) Develop the ESNCM orchestras (130 members (55% females), c)Produce and promote music productions of young musicians locally and internationally. 

The project will target all areas of West Bank, Gaza, and East Jerusalem.</narrative>
  </description>
